decided to introduce a new product to ensure you will not be liable for any=
 damaged equipment (within the coverage limit) and will be protected agains=
t financial losses. As of 22 April 2024, a new product, called Container Pr=
otect Essential (CP1), will come into effect, as a value added service to a=
ll shipments into Australia and New Zealand. For export shipments out of Au=
stralia and New Zealand the destination tariff rate, coverage limits and ap=
plication logic will apply. You can also upgrade to Container Protect Unlim=
